  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "生命周期与状态",
      "items": [
        "Fragment 在 onViewCreated 里 setView(this) 并 initialize，onResume / onPause 转发给 Presenter",
        "Presenter 每次回调前都检查 view.isReady()，连接错误时还会看 isAlreadyLoaded 避免覆盖已有数据"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "线程边界",
      "items": [
        "Interactor.execute 只把自身交给 Executor，ThreadExecutor 用 3/5 线程池 submit",
        "run() 里 Thread.sleep(1500) 模拟网络，随后必须经 MainThread.post 才回调 Presenter，回调始终在主线程"
      ]
    }
  ]
